y":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBOpt}(f)\\coloneqq\\left(\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(x),\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(x)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBOpt}(f)\\coloneqq\\left(\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(x),\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}f(x)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\leq f(y))\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(f)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\geq f(y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(f)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\leq f(y))\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{PBArgmax}(f)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\mid\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\geq f(y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非空有限 Boolean cube 保证两端极值及两类优化点都存在。这是优化问题的数学接口，并不指定输入编码或求解时间。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"tar